# "An artifact or enchantment card" and nothing else: the search offers neither the Lightning Bolt (instant), the Island (land)
# nor the Counterspell (instant) - the refusals - while the Mox Sapphire (artifact) and Rancor (enchantment) are the cards
# it can find. Cast in Bot2's upkeep (it is an instant), Bot1 takes Rancor, which goes on top of the library and so is the
# card drawn in turn three's draw step, not the Lightning Bolt that was on top before.

